WEBVTT

00:14:57.496 --> 00:15:00.579
you were a high school cheerleader
and the homecoming queen.

00:15:01.787 --> 00:15:05.121
And so you you were an overachiever
from day one.

00:15:05.496 --> 00:15:09.537
Aha. I was. I was. So let me explain.

00:15:09.537 --> 00:15:14.329
My stepfather, who was a carpenter, he
was seven years younger than my mom.

00:15:14.329 --> 00:15:20.162
They they married when I was like 11
and he was working under the table

00:15:20.912 --> 00:15:25.621
for this roofing contractor. And it was
the middle of the winter in Minnesota.

00:15:25.621 --> 00:15:28.412
There was ice on the roof. He slid
off the roof and broke his back.

00:15:29.371 --> 00:15:34.912
And as I said, we were always flat broke
and he was injured and out of work